### Start a new chat (generates a description + first response, stored under DEFAULT_USER_ID)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/chat-memory/start
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "message": "Hello, what's the capital of France?"
}

### List all chats for the default user
GET http://localhost:8080/api/chat-memory/

### Get messages for a specific chat (replace {{chatId}} with an id from the responses above)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/chat-memory/{{chatId}}

### Continue an existing chat (replace {{chatId}} with an id from the responses above)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/chat-memory/{{chatId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "message": "And what's a good dish to try there?"
}


###
POST http://localhost:8080/api/chat
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "message": "Tell me a joke"
}